# Entry Main: a value context with no result described (the book #structural-call, #return-in-data; step 21.7 K3). The
# data of C declares no `return`: the call in a value context is refused before any effect. The body would write node\seen,
# a field of D (node in C is D): D\seen stays 0. Answer 5; `return: 7` in the body describes nothing.
int: r 0
D:
    int: seen 0
    C:
        node\seen := 1
        return: 7
---
Main:
    node\r := D\C()
